Sophie development implementation

Original code uses the existing MIT LICENSE. The pinned pg driver and its
indirect packages retain their separate notices under legal/notices/.
See legal/storage-packages.json and ADR 0003 for exact versions, archive
integrity and the two named ISC indirect components. Optional pg-cloudflare
is inventoried but omitted from the native Windows installation.

The already installed Node.js runtime is used for development. Its distribution
contains third-party components with their own notices; review the exact release
before bundling or production deployment. See legal/DEPENDENCIES.json.

No Sophie artwork is bundled. The supplied reference documents contain
links/citations, not approval to copy upstream code.

MediaWiki site metadata reports CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for content. No article corpus or
third-party website asset/font has been copied into this foundation. Source and
asset rights must be recorded separately before ingestion or republication.

Existing PostgreSQL executables and supporting DLLs are used read-only for
isolated synthetic tests. They are not redistributed in this repository.
The PostgreSQL and installed command-line bundle notices remain with that
distribution; recorded hashes are in legal/postgresql-test-runtime.json.

Shuttle Activity sounds are selected but not yet bundled; see
legal/shuttle-activity-sounds.json. All are CC0 1.0 except one, which will be
credited here when it is bundled:
"Suspension: Mellow Electro-Ambient Soundscape" by kjartan_abel
(https://freesound.org/people/kjartan_abel/sounds/531854/), licensed under
CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

FFmpeg (LGPL-3.0-or-later build, pinned in legal/DEPENDENCIES.json and reviewed
in legal/ffmpeg-build-time-encoder.json) is approved only as a build-time tool on
the development machine, to convert those sounds. It is not redistributed with
or run by Sophie.
